  m_Name: EscEventOne
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: EscEventOne
  dialogueLines:
  - The player pressed Escape. Nothing happened. Interesting.
  - "The player has pressed Escape. Unfortunately, that doesn\u2019t do anything
    here."
  - Escape was pressed. The narrator has no idea what the player expected to happen.
  - "The player tried pressing Escape. Nice try, but there\u2019s nothing to escape
    from."
  - The player pressed Escape. The game remains completely unimpressed.
  - "The player appears to be looking for a pause menu. They won\u2019t find one
    here."
  - "Escape? No. That doesn\u2019t do anything."
  - "The player has pressed the Escape key. The narrator would like to remind them
    that this isn\u2019t that kind of game."
  - The player tried to escape. Unfortunately, pressing Escape is not going to help
    them.
  - The player pressed Escape again. The narrator admires their optimism, but nothing
    is happening.
  canRepeat: 0
  priority: 1
